# 👤 USER.md — Local Student Profile Template
# Copy this file to `USER.md` (which is git-ignored) so your AI assistant remembers your academic preferences.

- **Student Name:** Example Student
- **University / Faculty:** Universidad de Granada (UGR) — ETSIIT / Derecho / Medicina / Ciencias / Letras
- **Academic Profile:** Undergraduate (`pradogrado`) / Master (`pradoposgrado`) / Erasmus+ Mobility
- **Preferred Language:** Español / English / Italiano
- **Courses Root Directory:** `~/Documents/UGR_Courses`
- **Folder Routing Preset:** `smart` (`Teoria` vs `Practicas`) or `mirror` (Exact PRADO section names)
- **Active Semester:** `1` (Primer Cuatrimestre)
- **Lab / Seminar Subgroups:**
  - `ED_C`: `C2`
  - `SO_E`: `E3`
- **Preferred Calendar App:** Google Calendar / Apple Calendar / Outlook / Thunderbird (`deadlines.ics`)
- **AI Summarization Mode:** `deterministic` (100% free, no API keys) / `ollama` / `deepseek` / `gemini` / `openai`
